      "label": "Mark Zuckerberg as a public figure",
      "description": "The meme references Mark Zuckerberg, the co-founder and CEO of Facebook (now Meta Platforms, Inc.), who is a globally recognized tech billionaire and public figure. His image is used to imply that even high-profile, powerful individuals are subject to embarrassing or uncomfortable situations, which is a common comedic device in internet memes.",
